              "texts": [
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "value": "Today, EquipmentShare (YC W15) goes public. From Missouri to 373 locations nationwide, they've built the operating system construction has been missing—built by contractors, for contractors. Congrats to Jabbok, Willy, and the EquipmentShare team on a huge milestone."
                }
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "link": "https://www.ycombinator.com/blog/congratulations-to-equipmentshare",
                  "texts": [
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "value": "Congratulations to EquipmentShare on Going Public"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "link": "https://www.ycombinator.com/blog/author/garry",
                  "texts": [
                    {
                      "tag": "span",
                      "value": "Garry Tan"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "span",
                      "value": "1/23/2026"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "link": "https://www.ycombinator.com/blog/congratulations-to-equipmentshare",
                  "texts": [
                    {
                      "tag": "a",
                      "value": "Read More"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "texts": [
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "value": "We've partnered with nearly two dozen companies to offer students who attend YC events a suite of over $25,000 in free credits for AI devtools."
                }
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "link": "https://www.ycombinator.com/blog/the-yc-ai-student-starter-pack",
                  "texts": [
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "value": "Announcing the YC AI Stack"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "link": "https://www.ycombinator.com/blog/author/ankit-gupta",
                  "texts": [
                    {
                      "tag": "span",
                      "value": "Ankit Gupta"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "span",
                      "value": "1/16/2026"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "link": "https://www.ycombinator.com/blog/the-yc-ai-student-starter-pack",
                  "texts": [
                    {
                      "tag": "a",
                      "value": "Read More"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "texts": [
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "value": "We’re excited to share the Demo Day dates for 2026 so founders, investors, and our broader community can plan ahead."
                }
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "link": "https://www.ycombinator.com/blog/2026-demo-days",
                  "texts": [
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "value": "2026 Demo Day Dates"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "link": "https://www.ycombinator.com/blog/author/yc",
                  "texts": [
                    {
                      "tag": "span",
                      "value": "Y Combinator"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "span",
                      "value": "12/18/2025"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "link": "https://www.ycombinator.com/blog/2026-demo-days",
                  "texts": [
                    {
                      "tag": "a",
                      "value": "Read More"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "texts": [
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "value": "Meesho goes public today. From S16 to IPO, they’ve built one of India’s largest e-commerce platforms—empowering millions of small merchants to grow their businesses. Congrats to Vidit and Sanjeev on a decade of relentless building and listening to users!"
                }
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "link": "https://www.ycombinator.com/blog/meesho-goes-public",
                  "texts": [
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "value": "Meesho Goes Public"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "link": "https://www.ycombinator.com/blog/author/tim-brady",
                  "texts": [
                    {
                      "tag": "span",
                      "value": "Tim Brady"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "span",
                      "value": "12/10/2025"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "link": "https://www.ycombinator.com/blog/meesho-goes-public",
                  "texts": [
                    {
                      "tag": "a",
                      "value": "Read More"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "texts": [
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "value": "Today, Groww, India's leading digital investing platform, goes public. Tens of millions use Groww to invest simply and confidently in stocks, mutual funds, and ETFs. As YC's first company to list in India, we couldn't be more proud."
                }
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "link": "https://www.ycombinator.com/blog/groww",
                  "texts": [
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "value": "Congratulations to Groww"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "link": "https://www.ycombinator.com/blog/author/jon-levy",
                  "texts": [
                    {
                      "tag": "span",
                      "value": "Jon Levy"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "span",
                      "value": "11/12/2025"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "link": "https://www.ycombinator.com/blog/groww",
                  "texts": [
                    {
                      "tag": "a",
                      "value": "Read More"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "texts": [
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "value": "Today, BillionToOne goes public, becoming YC's fourth publicly traded biotech company. More importantly, they have built one of the most important genetic tests in the U.S. Today, 1 in 11 babies born in the US are tested with BillionToOne's fetal genetic test."
                }
              ],
              "children": [
